 ts and local community members are welcome to attend.\n\nWe hope to see yo
 u there\, con las manos arriba!!🙋‍♀️🙋‍♂️\n\nAlt Text: Da
 rk purple background with white text that reads "La Gran Tardeada"\, "Save
