  Davis East Quad"\, and Cross Cultural Center logo. Pictures depict La Gra
 n Tardeada 2025 attendees\, lowriders\, a mechanical bull\, and members fr
 om Danzantes del Alma. A graphic on the lower left side depicts a group of
  people dancing.
